t = t & "[Page 9-2]"
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "9-3. Requirement for INACT Reports. FITREPS, CHIEFEVALS and EVALS must be done for all periods in which a reservist is assigned by IDT orders to a drilling Reserve billet and or unit. This includes members in an IAP status (i.e., no mobilization billet orders) and drilling VTU or USNR-S1 members. Submit periodic reports as specified in table 1 of enclosure (1) in this instruction. Block 5 must be marked INACT and the report must be submitted by the appropriate reporting senior as defined in paragraph 9-4 below."
