t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "(2) COs of non-commissioned/readiness/augment Navy Reserve units will be reported on by the commander or CO of the unit's ACDU supported command. Such officers will also be assigned in an ADDU status to their respective Navy Reserve echelon 4 commander."
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
