t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "13-4. Required Comments"
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "a. Specifically substantiate all 1.0 grades and when three or more traits are evaluated 2.0. Correlate the comments by block number to the performance trait being discussed. General comments on the remainder of the evaluative blocks are required. You may substantiate more than one trait with a single bullet or paragraph."
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
