t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "(7) A reporting senior has a duty to report significant and persistent weaknesses, but do not use comments merely to get the member's attention."
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "(8) Declining Performance. A decline in performance is defined as receiving lower grades on two or more performance traits in the same paygrade by the same reporting senior on subsequent reports. Comments should justify the decline."
t = t & vbCrLf
