t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "17-3. Report Input. Service members will not be required to write their own performance EVAL reports. However, the Service member's input aids a rater or reporting senior in preparing a timely and complete report. A Service member has the right to submit FITREP, CHIEFEVAL, or EVAL inputs and has the duty to do so if requested by the rater or reporting senior. Suggested outlines are provided in exhibits 17-1 and 17-2."
