t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & "Note: Format for block 20 must be from oldest to most recent PFA performed during the reporting period. Format for block 20 must be from oldest to most recent PFA performed during the reporting period (e.g., PF in block 20 and PFA: 17-1/18-2 in block 27 indicates that the member passed 2017 cycle one and failed 2018 cycle two."
t = t & vbCrLf
t = t & vbCrLf
